# Allowed Bash prefixes for the Phase 2 action orchestrator ITSELF.
# Like the triage orchestrator, it only DISCOVERS and delegates. The single thing it
# runs directly is listing the actionable mail; extraction (read) and creation (write
# to Tasks/Calendar) belong to its subagents, each gated by its own allowlist.
gws gmail users messages list
gws gmail users threads list
gws schema

# Read-only filter pipes permitted by bash-guard:
#   jq grep head tail cut sort uniq wc tr cat rev nl column
